  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Experience the thrill of mini robot soccer with this innovative battle set. Featuring Remote control, SoccerBots deliver powerful kicks and precise movements for strategic matches. The system encourages creativity through event-based programming, allowing you to code special moves and custom rules. Furthermore, the fully 3D-printable design enables endless DIY upgrades. You can choose your preferred filament color to print the SoccerBot, experience a dynamic and customizable platform where high-tech meets the thrill of competition."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Ready to build your own soccer game? Find all files and details on its MakerWorld Page."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "*For a smooth build, we recommend reviewing the assembly guide first."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Remote Control Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The SoccerBot is designed to work with the CyberBrick Official Remote. Pre-configured settings have been uploaded for immediate play,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "while the CyberBrick App allows full customization of controller functions to match your personal preferences."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "* Please visit the CyberBrick Official Standard Remote on Makerworld for more details."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Important Notices"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To ensure safety, please read and carefully follow the guidelines below. Minors must be under direct adult supervision when using this product."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Intended Users: This product is intended for users aged 16 and above. Users under the age of 16 must be under direct adult supervision throughout use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Firmware Safety: Please use only official tools for any firmware operations. Flashing with third-party tools is not supported and may cause irreversible damage, which is not covered by warranty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Operational Safety: Do not touch the moving tracks or wheels while the device is operating to prevent pinching injuries, and do not make any modifications to the ball launcher."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Battery & Charging: DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A, only the officially designated battery and charger must be used. Avoid exposing the battery to high temperatures or water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Maintenance & Storage: Before use, inspect all 3D-printed parts and sand down any sharp edges or burrs if present. Store the model and small parts in a location out of reach of children and pets to prevent choking hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Our company is not liable for any equipment damage, failure, fire, or other loss caused by non-compliance with the above requirements."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Please strictly follow the safety instructions for this product."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\">Overview</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Experience the thrill of mini robot soccer with this innovative battle set. Featuring Remote control, SoccerBots deliver powerful kicks and precise movements for strategic matches. The system encourages creativity through event-based programming, allowing you to code special moves and custom rules. Furthermore, the fully 3D-printable design enables endless DIY upgrades. You can choose your preferred filament color to print the SoccerBot, experience a dynamic and customizable platform where high-tech meets the thrill of competition.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Ready to build your own soccer game?<br/>Find all files and details on its <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1395987-cyberbrick-official-soccerbot?from=search#profileId-1446987\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">MakerWorld Page</a></strong></span>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>*For a smooth build, we recommend reviewing the assembly guide first.</em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px;\">Remote Control Instruction</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\">The SoccerBot is designed to work with the CyberBrick Official Remote. Pre-configured settings have been uploaded for immediate play,</p>\n<p>while the CyberBrick App allows full customization of controller functions to match your personal preferences.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">* Please visit the <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1395991-cyberbrick-official-standard-remote#profileId-1446992\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">CyberBrick Official Standard Remote on Makerworld</span> </strong></a>for more details.</span></em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: -30px;\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/8b0fc0d7d87f42a6be6df50b9cc7d19b/20250930-110852_1.png\" height=\"537\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"1500\"/></p>\n<!-- 下载指引 -->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://bambulab.com/en/download/cyberbrick-apps\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/2697819904b841308fef067ae8929b3e/APP-D.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"1920\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">CyberBrick App Connection Tutorial</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">In The Box</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Item Number</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Item Name</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Quantity</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><a href=\"../../../products/cyberbrick-hardware-kit\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\">CyberBrick Ultimate Hardware Kit - ZK003 (2 Cars, 2 Remotes)</a></strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Gift Number</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Gift Name</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Quantity</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个